Phasmid: media queries and touch points

What:     pointer, hover, any-pointer, any-hover, navigator.maxTouchPoints,
          prefers-color-scheme, prefers-reduced-motion, prefers-contrast,
          forced-colors, color-gamut, dynamic-range and the
          Sec-CH-Prefers-Color-Scheme and Sec-CH-Prefers-Reduced-Motion hints
          come from the profile, headful, headless and under Xvfb. Input
          device and theme changes recompute the same values; DevTools
          emulation still applies.
Why:      Stock headless reports no pointer and no hover, and a headful run
          reports the host's input devices, theme and color profile.
Profile:  display.pointer.*, display.color_gamut, display.dynamic_range,
          display.prefers_color_scheme, display.prefers_reduced_motion,
          display.prefers_contrast, display.forced_colors,
          hardware.max_touch_points
Hooks:    content/browser/web_contents/slow_web_preference_cache.cc
          SlowWebPreferenceCache::Update;
          content/browser/web_contents/web_contents_impl.cc
          ComputeWebPreferences;
          chrome/browser/chrome_content_browser_client.cc
          GetPreferredContrast, GetForcedColorsForWebContent,
          GetPreferredColorScheme;
          content/browser/renderer_host/render_widget_host_impl.cc
          GetVisualProperties
Contexts: main, iframe, headers; workers have no matchMedia or maxTouchPoints
Guard:    tests/guards/display/media-queries.py

